0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 702.39 Tm (Article 14 of the EU AI Act organises human oversight of high-risk systems as a design duty and as an) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 687.79 Tm (operational duty. The system must be built so that natural persons can oversee it. Those persons must) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 673.19 Tm (be able to understand the relevant capacities and limitations, to monitor the operation for anomalies, to) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 658.59 Tm (interpret the output correctly, to decide not to use the system or to disregard its output, to intervene, and) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 643.99 Tm (to interrupt the system through a stop. Oversight that exists only in a policy slide, or only in a narrative) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 629.39 Tm (written after a dispute, does not meet the article. The oversight has to be exercisable on the individual) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 614.79 Tm (operation, and the fact that it was exercised has to be reconstructible.) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 592.19 Tm (Annex III, point 3, brings into the high-risk class AI systems intended to be used to determine access or) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 577.59 Tm (admission to educational and vocational training institutions, to evaluate learning outcomes, to assess the) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 562.99 Tm (appropriate level of education for an individual, and to monitor and detect prohibited behaviour of students) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 548.39 Tm (during tests. Adjacent public-service uses fall under the high-risk class when they evaluate eligibility for) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 533.79 Tm (essential public assistance, or when they are used by public authorities to evaluate creditworthiness or to) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 519.19 Tm (dispatch emergency services. The educational limb is the one universities meet first: admission scoring,) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 504.59 Tm (proctoring, automated marking support, and dropout-risk models that trigger an intervention in a student's) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 489.99 Tm (path are not outside the Act because the operator is a public university.) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 467.39 Tm (A static PDF audit fails this framework for four structural reasons. First, a PDF is a presentation, not a) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 452.79 Tm (state. The same dashboard can emit a different file tomorrow without a trace that the oversight log) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 438.19 Tm (changed. Second, the file is ordinarily produced by the vendor, so the buyer cannot show that the artefact) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 423.59 Tm (was computed from the buyer's own canonical records. Third, the PDF does not bind three objects that) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 408.99 Tm (Article 14 and Annex III make inseparable: the system metadata, the classification matrix that justifies) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 394.39 Tm (the high-risk treatment, and the log of the human decision to accept, override, or stop the output. Fourth,) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 379.79 Tm (a PDF is a poor exhibit in administrative review. It can be disputed as a selective export. It cannot be) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 365.19 Tm (recomputed.) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 342.59 Tm (The legal consequence is narrow and practical. Where Annex III §3 or a neighbouring high-risk heading) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 327.99 Tm (applies, the institution must keep an oversight record that a third party can test. The record has to travel) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 313.39 Tm (with the decision, not with the vendor's marketing archive. The remainder of this paper specifies that) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 298.79 Tm (record as a cryptographic commitment computed locally, and it refuses the substitute that the market) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 284.19 Tm (currently sells: a detector score printed into a PDF and treated as if it were an audit.) Tj ET
