0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 718.89 Tm (VerifIA is the protocol layer. It normalises the three objects an auditor must see together: the system) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 704.29 Tm (metadata, the Annex III classification matrix, and the human-oversight log. WaqfLedger is the utility that) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 689.69 Tm (stores the resulting receipt. The architecture is deliberately small. It does not move the student file, the) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 675.09 Tm (prompt, the answer script, or the mark book to the ledger. It moves a commitment.) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 652.49 Tm (The canonical preimage is the concatenation, in a fixed order and a fixed encoding, of those three objects.) Tj ET
