0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 510.89 Tm (whether the output was followed, overridden, or stopped, and the Article 50 declaration where the use is) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
