0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 415.29 Tm (WaqfLedger retains those receipt fields. It does not retain the preimage. Zero PII retention is a storage) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 400.69 Tm (rule, not a slogan: names, student identifiers, free-text justifications, scripts, and prompts are excluded) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 386.09 Tm (from the ledger by the shape of the protocol. If a field would identify a person, it stays inside the) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 371.49 Tm (institution's own record, inside the preimage, and outside the receipt.) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 348.89 Tm (The construction is zero-knowledge in the operational sense required of a public receipt. A verifier who) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 334.29 Tm (sees the ledger learns that a named institution sealed a named canonical state at a named time. The) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 319.69 Tm (verifier does not learn the personal data inside that state. Knowledge of the underlying records remains) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 305.09 Tm (with the controller. When an audit is lawfully opened, the controller recomputes SHA-256 over the) Tj ET
