0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 224.09 Tm (The Act's audit problem, as this Institute states it, is integrity plus data minimisation. SHA-256 over a) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 209.49 Tm (canonical local preimage solves both if, and only if, the preimage is complete and the institution actually) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 194.89 Tm (keeps it. A receipt of an empty log is a truthful receipt of an empty log, and an empty log will not satisfy) Tj ET
0.0980 0.1216 0.1725 rg
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.00 180.29 Tm (Article 14. The protocol does not launder a missing oversight act into a compliant one.) Tj ET
